Parsing: Who Did What to Whom","stamp":"DEPENDENCY PARSING: WHO DID WHAT TO WHOM","topic":""},{"id":"u3-03","number":13,"name":"Transition-Based Parsing: Building Trees Step by Step","stamp":"TRANSITION-BASED PARSING: BUILDING TREES STEP BY STEP","topic":""},{"id":"u4-01","number":14,"name":"Word Vectors: Giving Words a Place on a Map","stamp":"WORD VECTORS: GIVING WORDS A PLACE ON A MAP","topic":""},{"id":"u4-02","number":15,"name":"Word2Vec: Learning Word Vectors from Context","stamp":"WORD2VEC: LEARNING WORD VECTORS FROM CONTEXT","topic":""},{"id":"u4-03","number":16,"name":"Recurrent Neural Networks: Reading with Memory","stamp":"RECURRENT NEURAL NETWORKS: READING WITH MEMORY","topic":""},{"id":"u4-04","number":17,"name":"LSTMs: Remembering What Matters","stamp":"LSTMS: REMEMBERING WHAT MATTERS","topic":""},{"id":"u5-01","number":18,"name":"Contextual Embeddings and ELMo","stamp":"CONTEXTUAL EMBEDDINGS AND ELMO","topic":""},{"id":"u5-02","number":19,"name":"BERT: Reading in Both Directions","stamp":"BERT: READING IN BOTH DIRECTIONS","topic":""}]},"stop":{"number":18,"name":"Contextual Embeddings and ELMo","stamp":"CONTEXTUAL EMBEDDINGS AND ELMO"},"shorts":{"width":1080,"height":1920,"maxSeconds":60,"cta":"Full lesson: NLP, Simply Explained · Unit 5"},"thumbnail":{"headline":"Same word, different meaning","big":"bank ≠ bank"},"segments":[{"id":"intro","kind":"intro","component":"TitleCard","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c01","start":0.6,"end":8.741,"marks":{},"text":"Welcome to unit five of NLP, Simply Explained. This is lesson 1: contextual embeddings, and a model called ELMo.","words":[{"w":"Welcome","start":0.6},{"w":"to","start":1.04},{"w":"unit","start":1.24},{"w":"five","start":1.6},{"w":"of","start":2},{"w":"NLP,","start":2.4},{"w":"Simply","start":2.8},{"w":"Explained.","start":3.48},{"w":"This","start":4.32},{"w":"is","start":4.68},{"w":"lesson","start":5.04},{"w":"1:","start":5.4},{"w":"contextual","start":5.96},{"w":"embeddings,","start":6.52},{"w":"and","start":7.16},{"w":"a","start":7.32},{"w":"model","start":7.48},{"w":"called","start":7.88},{"w":"ELMo.","start":8.24}]},{"id":"c02","start":9.141,"end":14.858,"marks":{},"text":"In unit four, every word got one vector. Today we fix the biggest problem with that idea.","words":[{"w":"In","start":9.141},{"w":"unit","start":9.301},{"w":"four,","start":9.661},{"w":"every","start":10.101},{"w":"word","start":10.421},{"w":"got","start":10.741},{"w":"one","start":11.161},{"w":"vector.","start":11.581},{"w":"Today","start":12.001},{"w":"we","start":12.421},{"w":"fix","start":12.661},{"w":"the","start":12.941},{"w":"biggest","start":13.101},{"w":"problem","start":13.541},{"w":"with","start":13.981},{"w":"that","start":14.141},{"w":"idea.","start":14.341}]}],"title":"Welcome","shortTitle":"Welcome","props":{"kicker":"Unit 5 · Lesson 1","title":"Contextual Embeddings","subtitle":"One word, many meanings, many vectors"},"start":0.6,"end":14.858,"startFrame":0,"durationInFrames":473},{"id":"idea","kind":"core","component":"BigIdea","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c03","start":15.767,"end":21.185,"marks":{},"text":"Here's the idea. The same word should get a different vector when it's used in a different sentence.","words":[{"w":"Here's","start":15.767},{"w":"the","start":16.207},{"w":"idea.","start":16.407},{"w":"The","start":17.047},{"w":"same","start":17.327},{"w":"word","start":17.687},{"w":"should","start":17.967},{"w":"get","start":18.167},{"w":"a","start":18.327},{"w":"different","start":18.634},{"w":"vector","start":18.94},{"w":"when","start":19.247},{"w":"it's","start":19.407},{"w":"used","start":19.687},{"w":"in","start":20.007},{"w":"a","start":20.127},{"w":"different","start":20.247},{"w":"sentence.","start":20.607}]}],"title":"The big idea","shortTitle":"The big idea","props":{"kicker":"Key idea","text":"The same word should get a different vector in a different sentence.","highlight":["different vector"]},"start":15.767,"end":21.185,"startFrame":473,"durationInFrames":190},{"id":"vs","kind":"core","component":"Compare","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c04","start":22.1,"end":23.714,"marks":{},"text":"Let's compare the two kinds.","words":[{"w":"Let's","start":22.1},{"w":"compare","start":22.46},{"w":"the","start":22.82},{"w":"two","start":22.98},{"w":"kinds.","start":23.22}]},{"id":"c05","start":24.114,"end":32.329,"marks":{},"text":"Static vectors, like Word2Vec's, give each word exactly one vector. \"Bank\" always gets the same one, whatever the sentence.","words":[{"w":"Static","start":24.461},{"w":"vectors,","start":24.807},{"w":"like","start":25.154},{"w":"Word2Vec's,","start":25.794},{"w":"give","start":26.434},{"w":"each","start":26.674},{"w":"word","start":26.954},{"w":"exactly","start":27.234},{"w":"one","start":27.821},{"w":"vector.","start":28.407},{"w":"\"Bank\"","start":28.994},{"w":"always","start":29.514},{"w":"gets","start":29.994},{"w":"the","start":30.314},{"w":"same","start":30.514},{"w":"one,","start":30.794},{"w":"whatever","start":31.074},{"w":"the","start":31.514},{"w":"sentence.","start":31.674}]},{"id":"c06","start":32.729,"end":42.081,"marks":{},"text":"Contextual vectors give a word a fresh vector every time it's used, based on the sentence around it. So a river bank and a money bank get different vectors.","words":[{"w":"Contextual","start":33.156},{"w":"vectors","start":33.582},{"w":"give","start":34.009},{"w":"a","start":34.249},{"w":"word","start":34.369},{"w":"a","start":34.649},{"w":"fresh","start":34.982},{"w":"vector","start":35.316},{"w":"every","start":35.649},{"w":"time","start":35.929},{"w":"it's","start":36.169},{"w":"used,","start":36.489},{"w":"based","start":37.009},{"w":"on","start":37.409},{"w":"the","start":37.529},{"w":"sentence","start":37.689},{"w":"around","start":38.169},{"w":"it.","start":38.689},{"w":"So","start":39.049},{"w":"a","start":39.289},{"w":"river","start":39.449},{"w":"bank","start":39.769},{"w":"and","start":40.089},{"w":"a","start":40.249},{"w":"money","start":40.329},{"w":"bank","start":40.609},{"w":"get","start":40.889},{"w":"different","start":41.286},{"w":"vectors.","start":41.684}]}],"title":"Static versus contextual","shortTitle":"Static versus contextual","props":{"kicker":"Two kinds","title":"Static versus contextual vectors","columns":[{"title":"Static (Word2Vec)","items":["one vector per word","“bank” is always the same"],"tone":"bad"},{"title":"Contextual (ELMo)","items":["a new vector in every sentence","river bank ≠ money bank"],"tone":"good"}],"verdict":{"text":"Meaning depends on context"}},"start":22.1,"end":42.081,"startFrame":663,"durationInFrames":627},{"id":"bank","kind":"core","component":"Table","short":true,"cues":[{"id":"c07","start":43,"end":48.71,"marks":{},"text":"Here's the word \"bank\" in three sentences. A contextual model gives it three different vectors.","words":[{"w":"Here's","start":43.18},{"w":"the","start":43.36},{"w":"word","start":43.52},{"w":"\"bank\"","start":43.8},{"w":"in","start":44.24},{"w":"three","start":44.44},{"w":"sentences.","start":44.76},{"w":"A","start":45.72},{"w":"contextual","start":46.18},{"w":"model","start":46.64},{"w":"gives","start":47},{"w":"it","start":47.28},{"w":"three","start":47.44},{"w":"different","start":47.863},{"w":"vectors.","start":48.287}]},{"id":"c08","start":49.11,"end":51.956,"marks":{},"text":"\"We sat on the bank of the river\": the side of a river.","words":[{"w":"\"We","start":49.11},{"w":"sat","start":49.27},{"w":"on","start":49.55},{"w":"the","start":49.67},{"w":"bank","start":49.79},{"w":"of","start":50.07},{"w":"the","start":50.19},{"w":"river\":","start":50.35},{"w":"the","start":50.657},{"w":"side","start":50.963},{"w":"of","start":51.27},{"w":"a","start":51.39},{"w":"river.","start":51.51}]},{"id":"c09","start":52.356,"end":55.327,"marks":{},"text":"\"I paid money into the bank\": a place that keeps money.","words":[{"w":"\"I","start":52.356},{"w":"paid","start":52.516},{"w":"money","start":52.796},{"w":"into","start":53.116},{"w":"the","start":53.276},{"w":"bank\":","start":53.436},{"w":"a","start":53.836},{"w":"place","start":54.036},{"w":"that","start":54.316},{"w":"keeps","start":54.556},{"w":"money.","start":54.916}]},{"id":"c10","start":55.727,"end":59.25,"marks":{},"text":"\"Don't bank on it\": here it's a verb, meaning to rely on something.","words":[{"w":"\"Don't","start":55.727},{"w":"bank","start":56.007},{"w":"on","start":56.327},{"w":"it\":","start":56.527},{"w":"here","start":56.727},{"w":"it's","start":56.967},{"w":"a","start":57.207},{"w":"verb,","start":57.447},{"w":"meaning","start":57.687},{"w":"to","start":58.007},{"w":"rely","start":58.167},{"w":"on","start":58.567},{"w":"something.","start":58.807}]}],"title":"One word, three meanings","shortTitle":"Why “bank” needs three different meanings in AI","props":{"kicker":"Example","title":"Three sentences with “bank”","columns":["Sentence","Meaning"],"rows":[["We sat on the bank of the river","the side of a river"],["I paid money into the bank","a place for money"],["Don't bank on it","to rely on (a verb)"]],"highlight":[{"row":0,"col":1},{"row":1,"col":1},{"row":2,"col":1}]},"start":43,"end":59.25,"startFrame":1290,"durationInFrames":515},{"id":"elmo","kind":"core","component":"Definition","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c11","start":60.167,"end":73.921,"marks":{},"text":"ELMo, from 2018, stands for embeddings from language models. Its word vectors come out of a deep language model built from LSTMs reading in both directions, so each vector depends on the whole sentence.","words":[{"w":"ELMo,","start":60.427},{"w":"from","start":60.687},{"w":"2018,","start":60.887},{"w":"stands","start":62.247},{"w":"for","start":62.647},{"w":"embeddings","start":62.807},{"w":"from","start":63.487},{"w":"language","start":63.647},{"w":"models.","start":64.087},{"w":"Its","start":64.887},{"w":"word","start":65.26},{"w":"vectors","start":65.634},{"w":"come","start":66.007},{"w":"out","start":66.247},{"w":"of","start":66.367},{"w":"a","start":66.487},{"w":"deep","start":66.567},{"w":"language","start":66.887},{"w":"model","start":67.367},{"w":"built","start":67.767},{"w":"from","start":68.354},{"w":"LSTMs","start":68.94},{"w":"reading","start":69.527},{"w":"in","start":69.927},{"w":"both","start":70.087},{"w":"directions,","start":70.407},{"w":"so","start":71.207},{"w":"each","start":71.54},{"w":"vector","start":71.874},{"w":"depends","start":72.207},{"w":"on","start":72.687},{"w":"the","start":72.807},{"w":"whole","start":72.967},{"w":"sentence.","start":73.287}]},{"id":"c12","start":74.321,"end":80.6,"marks":{},"text":"For \"bank\" in our first sentence, the vector is computed from everything around it: sat on the, of the river.","words":[{"w":"For","start":74.321},{"w":"\"bank\"","start":74.521},{"w":"in","start":74.881},{"w":"our","start":75.041},{"w":"first","start":75.201},{"w":"sentence,","start":75.441},{"w":"the","start":75.841},{"w":"vector","start":76.241},{"w":"is","start":76.641},{"w":"computed","start":76.801},{"w":"from","start":77.281},{"w":"everything","start":77.521},{"w":"around","start":77.961},{"w":"it:","start":78.441},{"w":"sat","start":78.881},{"w":"on","start":79.281},{"w":"the,","start":79.481},{"w":"of","start":79.761},{"w":"the","start":79.961},{"w":"river.","start":80.161}]},{"id":"c13","start":81,"end":85.908,"marks":{},"text":"It's like asking someone what a word means while they're holding the whole sentence in mind.","words":[{"w":"It's","start":81},{"w":"like","start":81.24},{"w":"asking","start":81.44},{"w":"someone","start":81.94},{"w":"what","start":82.44},{"w":"a","start":82.68},{"w":"word","start":82.84},{"w":"means","start":83.12},{"w":"while","start":83.48},{"w":"they're","start":83.72},{"w":"holding","start":83.96},{"w":"the","start":84.32},{"w":"whole","start":84.44},{"w":"sentence","start":84.72},{"w":"in","start":85.28},{"w":"mind.","start":85.48}]}],"title":"What is ELMo?","shortTitle":"What is ELMo?","props":{"kicker":"2018","term":"ELMo","definition":"Embeddings from Language Models: word vectors taken from a deep, two-way LSTM language model, so each depends on the whole sentence.","example":"bank → computed from “sat on the … of the river”","analogy":"Asking what a word means while holding the whole sentence in mind."},"start":60.167,"end":85.908,"startFrame":1805,"durationInFrames":800},{"id":"build","kind":"core","component":"Steps","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c14","start":86.833,"end":88.797,"marks":{},"text":"Here's how it works, in four steps.","words":[{"w":"Here's","start":86.973},{"w":"how","start":87.113},{"w":"it","start":87.273},{"w":"works,","start":87.473},{"w":"in","start":87.793},{"w":"four","start":87.993},{"w":"steps.","start":88.273}]},{"id":"c15","start":89.197,"end":100.622,"marks":{},"text":"Pretrain: train two LSTM language models on a huge amount of plain text. One predicts the next word, reading forwards. The other predicts the previous word, reading backwards.","words":[{"w":"Pretrain:","start":89.197},{"w":"train","start":89.917},{"w":"two","start":90.437},{"w":"LSTM","start":90.957},{"w":"language","start":91.477},{"w":"models","start":91.917},{"w":"on","start":92.397},{"w":"a","start":92.557},{"w":"huge","start":92.677},{"w":"amount","start":93.037},{"w":"of","start":93.397},{"w":"plain","start":93.517},{"w":"text.","start":93.877},{"w":"One","start":94.597},{"w":"predicts","start":94.957},{"w":"the","start":95.477},{"w":"next","start":95.597},{"w":"word,","start":95.957},{"w":"reading","start":96.237},{"w":"forwards.","start":96.677},{"w":"The","start":97.437},{"w":"other","start":97.677},{"w":"predicts","start":97.997},{"w":"the","start":98.477},{"w":"previous","start":98.637},{"w":"word,","start":99.157},{"w":"reading","start":99.477},{"w":"backwards.","start":99.957}]},{"id":"c16","start":101.022,"end":103.528,"marks":{},"text":"Read: run both models over your sentence.","words":[{"w":"Read:","start":101.022},{"w":"run","start":101.502},{"w":"both","start":101.862},{"w":"models","start":102.182},{"w":"over","start":102.622},{"w":"your","start":102.782},{"w":"sentence.","start":102.942}]},{"id":"c17","start":103.928,"end":109.082,"marks":{},"text":"Mix: for each word, blend the outputs of their layers, using weights learned for your task.","words":[{"w":"Mix:","start":103.928},{"w":"for","start":104.408},{"w":"each","start":104.648},{"w":"word,","start":104.968},{"w":"blend","start":105.288},{"w":"the","start":105.648},{"w":"outputs","start":105.768},{"w":"of","start":106.248},{"w":"their","start":106.368},{"w":"layers,","start":106.568},{"w":"using","start":107.168},{"w":"weights","start":107.528},{"w":"learned","start":107.928},{"w":"for","start":108.248},{"w":"your","start":108.408},{"w":"task.","start":108.648}]},{"id":"c18","start":109.482,"end":115.505,"marks":{},"text":"Plug in: feed these vectors into your own model, for tagging, question answering, or whatever you're building.","words":[{"w":"Plug","start":109.669},{"w":"in:","start":109.855},{"w":"feed","start":110.042},{"w":"these","start":110.375},{"w":"vectors","start":110.709},{"w":"into","start":111.042},{"w":"your","start":111.242},{"w":"own","start":111.402},{"w":"model,","start":111.602},{"w":"for","start":112.122},{"w":"tagging,","start":112.629},{"w":"question","start":113.135},{"w":"answering,","start":113.642},{"w":"or","start":114.202},{"w":"whatever","start":114.442},{"w":"you're","start":114.762},{"w":"building.","start":115.082}]}],"title":"How ELMo works","shortTitle":"How ELMo works","props":{"kicker":"How it works","title":"How ELMo makes a vector","steps":[{"label":"Pretrain","detail":"a forward and a backward LSTM language model"},{"label":"Read","detail":"run both over your sentence"},{"label":"Mix","detail":"blend their layers for each word"},{"label":"Plug in","detail":"feed the vectors to your own model"}]},"start":86.833,"end":115.505,"startFrame":2605,"durationInFrames":888},{"id":"layers","kind":"core","component":"Bullets","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c19","start":116.433,"end":119.474,"marks":{},"text":"Why blend the layers? Because they learn different things.","words":[{"w":"Why","start":116.433},{"w":"blend","start":116.673},{"w":"the","start":116.993},{"w":"layers?","start":117.153},{"w":"Because","start":117.753},{"w":"they","start":118.033},{"w":"learn","start":118.273},{"w":"different","start":118.593},{"w":"things.","start":119.033}]},{"id":"c20","start":119.874,"end":123.421,"marks":{},"text":"The lower layers capture more about grammar, like parts of speech.","words":[{"w":"The","start":119.874},{"w":"lower","start":119.994},{"w":"layers","start":120.314},{"w":"capture","start":120.754},{"w":"more","start":121.194},{"w":"about","start":121.434},{"w":"grammar,","start":121.674},{"w":"like","start":122.234},{"w":"parts","start":122.474},{"w":"of","start":122.794},{"w":"speech.","start":122.914}]},{"id":"c21","start":123.821,"end":129.047,"marks":{},"text":"The higher layers capture more about meaning in context, like which sense of \"bank\" is meant.","words":[{"w":"The","start":123.821},{"w":"higher","start":123.981},{"w":"layers","start":124.221},{"w":"capture","start":124.701},{"w":"more","start":125.181},{"w":"about","start":125.421},{"w":"meaning","start":125.661},{"w":"in","start":125.941},{"w":"context,","start":126.221},{"w":"like","start":127.021},{"w":"which","start":127.261},{"w":"sense","start":127.501},{"w":"of","start":127.861},{"w":"\"bank\"","start":128.061},{"w":"is","start":128.461},{"w":"meant.","start":128.661}]},{"id":"c22","start":129.447,"end":132.163,"marks":{},"text":"So each task can lean on the layers it needs most.","words":[{"w":"So","start":129.447},{"w":"each","start":129.607},{"w":"task","start":129.887},{"w":"can","start":130.247},{"w":"lean","start":130.407},{"w":"on","start":130.647},{"w":"the","start":130.767},{"w":"layers","start":130.887},{"w":"it","start":131.287},{"w":"needs","start":131.447},{"w":"most.","start":131.807}]}],"title":"What the layers learn","shortTitle":"What the layers learn","props":{"kicker":"Inside ELMo","title":"Different layers, different knowledge","items":[{"text":"Lower layers: more about grammar"},{"text":"Higher layers: more about meaning in context"},{"text":"Each task can weight the layers it needs"}],"numbered":false},"start":116.433,"end":132.163,"startFrame":3493,"durationInFrames":499},{"id":"impact","kind":"core","component":"Bullets","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c23","start":133.067,"end":134.569,"marks":{},"text":"ELMo was a turning point.","words":[{"w":"ELMo","start":133.267},{"w":"was","start":133.467},{"w":"a","start":133.627},{"w":"turning","start":133.787},{"w":"point.","start":134.147}]},{"id":"c24","start":134.969,"end":139.44,"marks":{},"text":"Adding its vectors improved results across many NLP tasks at once.","words":[{"w":"Adding","start":134.969},{"w":"its","start":135.342},{"w":"vectors","start":135.716},{"w":"improved","start":136.089},{"w":"results","start":136.569},{"w":"across","start":137.049},{"w":"many","start":137.476},{"w":"NLP","start":137.902},{"w":"tasks","start":138.329},{"w":"at","start":138.889},{"w":"once.","start":139.049}]},{"id":"c25","start":139.84,"end":144.034,"marks":{},"text":"It proved that pretraining on plain, unlabelled text really pays off.","words":[{"w":"It","start":139.84},{"w":"proved","start":139.96},{"w":"that","start":140.32},{"w":"pretraining","start":140.52},{"w":"on","start":141.12},{"w":"plain,","start":141.48},{"w":"unlabelled","start":141.84},{"w":"text","start":142.56},{"w":"really","start":142.96},{"w":"pays","start":143.32},{"w":"off.","start":143.72}]},{"id":"c26","start":144.434,"end":147.829,"marks":{},"text":"And it opened the door to BERT, our next and final lesson.","words":[{"w":"And","start":144.434},{"w":"it","start":144.594},{"w":"opened","start":144.754},{"w":"the","start":145.034},{"w":"door","start":145.194},{"w":"to","start":145.474},{"w":"BERT,","start":145.634},{"w":"our","start":146.114},{"w":"next","start":146.354},{"w":"and","start":146.674},{"w":"final","start":147.059},{"w":"lesson.","start":147.444}]}],"title":"Why it mattered","shortTitle":"Why it mattered","props":{"kicker":"Impact","title":"Why ELMo mattered","items":[{"text":"Better results across many NLP tasks"},{"text":"Proved that pretraining on plain text pays off"},{"text":"Opened the door to BERT"}],"numbered":false},"start":133.067,"end":147.829,"startFrame":3992,"durationInFrames":470},{"id":"quiz","kind":"quiz","component":"Quiz","short":true,"cues":[{"id":"c27","start":148.733,"end":153.25,"marks":{},"text":"Quick quiz. What's the main difference between ELMo's vectors and Word2Vec's?","words":[{"w":"Quick","start":148.986},{"w":"quiz.","start":149.24},{"w":"What's","start":149.493},{"w":"the","start":149.813},{"w":"main","start":149.933},{"w":"difference","start":150.213},{"w":"between","start":150.653},{"w":"ELMo's","start":151.08},{"w":"vectors","start":151.506},{"w":"and","start":151.933},{"w":"Word2Vec's?","start":152.592}]},{"id":"c28","start":153.65,"end":155.17,"marks":{},"text":"Pause the video and choose.","words":[{"w":"Pause","start":153.65},{"w":"the","start":153.93},{"w":"video","start":154.19},{"w":"and","start":154.45},{"w":"choose.","start":154.65}]},{"id":"c29","start":158.57,"end":168.068,"marks":{},"text":"ELMo's vectors depend on the sentence. Word2Vec gives each word one fixed vector, but ELMo computes a new one every time the word is used.","words":[{"w":"ELMo's","start":158.93},{"w":"vectors","start":159.29},{"w":"depend","start":159.65},{"w":"on","start":160.09},{"w":"the","start":160.21},{"w":"sentence.","start":160.37},{"w":"Word2Vec","start":161.43},{"w":"gives","start":162.49},{"w":"each","start":162.81},{"w":"word","start":163.09},{"w":"one","start":163.37},{"w":"fixed","start":163.797},{"w":"vector,","start":164.223},{"w":"but","start":164.65},{"w":"ELMo","start":164.85},{"w":"computes","start":165.29},{"w":"a","start":165.77},{"w":"new","start":165.93},{"w":"one","start":166.17},{"w":"every","start":166.41},{"w":"time","start":166.73},{"w":"the","start":166.97},{"w":"word","start":167.17},{"w":"is","start":167.45},{"w":"used.","start":167.69}]}],"title":"Quick quiz","shortTitle":"Quick quiz: Word2Vec or ELMo?","props":{"kicker":"Pause and predict","question":"What's the main difference between ELMo vectors and Word2Vec vectors?","options":["ELMo vectors depend on the sentence","ELMo vectors are shorter","ELMo ignores word order"],"answer":0,"explain":"Word2Vec gives one vector per word; ELMo computes a new one from each sentence."},"start":148.733,"end":168.068,"startFrame":4462,"durationInFrames":608},{"id":"recap","kind":"recap","component":"Recap","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c30","start":169,"end":173.54,"marks":{},"text":"Let's recap. Static vectors give a word one vector, whatever the sentence.","words":[{"w":"Let's","start":169},{"w":"recap.","start":169.4},{"w":"Static","start":169.96},{"w":"vectors","start":170.52},{"w":"give","start":171.08},{"w":"a","start":171.28},{"w":"word","start":171.4},{"w":"one","start":171.72},{"w":"vector,","start":172.04},{"w":"whatever","start":172.36},{"w":"the","start":172.76},{"w":"sentence.","start":172.92}]},{"id":"c31","start":173.94,"end":178.472,"marks":{},"text":"Contextual vectors change with the sentence, so \"bank\" can mean different things.","words":[{"w":"Contextual","start":174.34},{"w":"vectors","start":174.74},{"w":"change","start":175.14},{"w":"with","start":175.46},{"w":"the","start":175.58},{"w":"sentence,","start":175.7},{"w":"so","start":176.42},{"w":"\"bank\"","start":176.74},{"w":"can","start":177.14},{"w":"mean","start":177.38},{"w":"different","start":177.62},{"w":"things.","start":178.06}]},{"id":"c32","start":178.872,"end":184.493,"marks":{},"text":"ELMo takes its vectors from a two-way LSTM language model, pretrained on lots of text.","words":[{"w":"ELMo","start":178.872},{"w":"takes","start":179.272},{"w":"its","start":179.579},{"w":"vectors","start":179.885},{"w":"from","start":180.1